{"detail":"<!doctype html><html lang=\"ko\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'none'; script-src 'none'; style-src 'unsafe-inline'; font-src 'self'; img-src https://daesan.ai https://*.daesan.ai https://cafe24img.com https://*.cafe24img.com https://www.kccworld.co.kr/assets/images/ho/bm/img_hb_mark.jpg; connect-src 'none'; base-uri 'none'; form-action 'none'\"><meta name=\"referrer\" content=\"no-referrer\"><style>@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:400;src:url(fonts/400) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:500;src:url(fonts/500) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:600;src:url(fonts/600) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:700;src:url(fonts/700) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}@font-face{font-family:Pretendard;font-weight:800;src:url(fonts/800) format(\"woff2\");font-display:swap}html,body{margin:0;padding:0}body{display:flow-root;font:12px/1.5 Pretendard,sans-serif;color:#353535}p,h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6,ul,ol,li,dl,dt,dd,figure{margin:0;padding:0}table{width:100%;border:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse}img{border:0;vertical-align:top;max-width:100%}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}#cafe24-detail{max-width:790px;margin:auto}@media(min-width:701px){#cafe24-detail h3.ds-block-title{font-size:12px;margin:0 0 20px}}@media(max-width:700px){body{font-size:13px;line-height:1.2;color:#1b1b1b}td,th{line-height:18px}#cafe24-detail{width:95.25%}}</style><style></style></head><body><div id=\"cafe24-detail\"><p align=\"left\">말라스 | 인도네시아</p><p align=\"left\"></p><p align=\"left\">동남아시아에 넓게 분포하는 수종으로, 나뭇결이 곱고 균일하며 약간의 광택이 특징입니다.</p><p align=\"left\">내구성이탁월하며 토양과 접하는 곳에 주로 사용됩니다.</p><p align=\"left\">말라스의 기건 비중은 0.77~1.06으로 평균 0.91입니다.</p><p align=\"left\">단단한 재질에 비해 톱질이 잘 되고 대패질과 연마도 잘 됩니다.</p><p align=\"left\">해충에 대단히 강하며 토양과 접하는 곳에 사용하여도 내구력이 있습니다.</p><p align=\"left\"></p><p align=\"left\">규격 : 3600 x 120 x 30mm</p><p align=\"left\"></p><p align=\"center\"><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"b0e11676788058a1a22f16daae365214_164131.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/b0e11676788058a1a22f16daae365214_164131.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"10ce87ae39df59b9d52f3204f8ec5ca1_164143.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/10ce87ae39df59b9d52f3204f8ec5ca1_164143.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /><img class=\"js-smart-img\" title=\"0040661bdd6edb285fe8006f87ff2823_164156.png\" src=\"https://ecimg.cafe24img.com/pg2383b21973322017/daesan3833/web/mig_img/prod/0040661bdd6edb285fe8006f87ff2823_164156.png\" /><br style=\"clear:both\" /></p></div></body></html>","additional":[],"unconfirmed":false}